WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.067
-It is time for our
latest installment of

00:00:03.067 --> 00:00:04.501
"Tonight Show Polls."
Here we go.

00:00:04.501 --> 00:00:09.834
-♪ "Tonight Show Polls" ♪

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:11.267
-This first poll asks...

00:00:22.634 --> 00:00:24.200
-Oh.

00:00:27.734 --> 00:00:28.868
-This next poll asks...

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:41.734
"The 'n."

00:00:43.767 --> 00:00:45.000
This next one asked...

00:01:01.634 --> 00:01:02.934
What?

00:01:05.234 --> 00:01:06.367
This next one asks...

00:01:17.567 --> 00:01:19.300
Interesting.

00:01:20.968 --> 00:01:22.133
This next one is interesting.

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:23.901
This next poll asks,
"Do you prefer sitting

00:01:23.901 --> 00:01:26.133
in a booth or at a table?"

00:01:26.133 --> 00:01:27.434
What do you think, Higgins?

00:01:27.434 --> 00:01:28.801
-I'm going to say booth.

00:01:28.801 --> 00:01:29.901
-Yeah. What do you think, Tariq?

00:01:29.901 --> 00:01:31.267
You feel like a
booth type of guy.

00:01:31.267 --> 00:01:33.901
-I'm definitely a booth person.
-Quest?

00:01:33.901 --> 00:01:34.968
-Booth.

00:01:34.968 --> 00:01:36.200
-I think everyone goes
booth, right?

00:01:36.200 --> 00:01:38.868
-I think.
Let's see what the poll says.

00:01:38.868 --> 00:01:40.133
-Alright. 55% said...

00:01:55.534 --> 00:01:58.267
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:58.267 --> 00:01:59.634
Oh!

00:01:59.634 --> 00:02:02.701
Indeed!
French fries? Feed them to me.

00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:04.701
-I love sharing
my food with you.

00:02:04.701 --> 00:02:06.801
-Mmm! Open the door!

00:02:06.801 --> 00:02:09.334
-[ Laughs ]
Open the hangar!

00:02:09.334 --> 00:02:11.501
We're adults. There we go.

00:02:11.501 --> 00:02:12.634
This next poll asks...

00:02:26.767 --> 00:02:28.067
This next poll asked...

00:02:39.868 --> 00:02:44.033
