00:02:44.033 --> 00:02:46.601
[ Vocalizing ]

00:02:46.601 --> 00:02:48.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:50.367 --> 00:02:51.467
The last poll asked...

00:03:01.067 --> 00:03:03.667
That's all the time we have for
"Tonight Show Polls."

00:03:03.667 --> 00:03:04.801
What a great show tonight.

